UID:ci0005472-tt28607951--2024-12-27-19-0
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 2h 19m (139 mins)\n\nAnora\, a young sex worker from
  Brooklyn\, meets and impulsively marries the son of an oligarch. Once the
  news reaches Russia\, her fairytale is threatened as his parents set out 
 for New York to get the marriage annulled.\n\nhttps://www.imdb.com/title/t
 t28607951/\n\nIMDb rating: 8.1
LOCATION:Grand Illusion Cinema\, Seattle\, 1403 NE 50th St\, Seattle\, WA\
 , 98105
